  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "辛味が　強い　食材。辛味が　非常に　強いので　好き嫌いがはっきり　分かれる　食材なのだ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "매운맛이 강한 식재료. 매운맛이 매우 강해서 호불호가 확실하게 갈리는 식재료다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "辣味強勁的食材。由於辣味非常強烈，所以人們對其的好惡相當分明。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût très épicé. Son goût est tellement relevé qu’il est très clivant : soit on l’aime, soit on le déteste.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine sehr scharfe Zutat. An ihrem außerordentlich hohen Schärfegrad scheiden sich die Geister.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente con un sabor muy picante, por lo que normalmente o se ama o se odia.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente molto piccante. La sua piccantezza estrema si ama o si odia senza mezze misure.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A very spicy ingredient—so spicy as to leave no room for ambivalence about it. You either like it or you don’t.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "辛味が　強い　食材。辛味が　非常に　強いので　好き嫌いがはっきり　分かれる　食材なのだ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "辣味强烈的食材。由于辣味非常之强，所以是喜恶两极化的食材。",
